 "messages": [
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "First, is the patient awake and responding to you normally, and are they having any trouble breathing right now?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:45:34",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.responsive+danger_signs.breathing_difficulty"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "Yes, he's awake and talking normally. He's been more short of breath than usual since this morning, but he can still speak in full sentences and isn't wheezing.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:45:36",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.responsive+danger_signs.breathing_difficulty"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you for letting me know. Does he have any chest pain right now, and is he bleeding heavily anywhere?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:45:46",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.chest_pain_now+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "No, he has no chest pain. I haven't seen him bleeding anywhere.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:45:48",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.chest_pain_now+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you, that's helpful to know. How old is he?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:45:55",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:patient.age"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He's 72, born 3 March 1954.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:45:56",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:patient.age"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you. Has he had a fever, and if you've taken his temperature, what was it? Have you noticed any new rash on him?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:04",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.fever+infection.rash"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "No fever and no rash. I haven't taken his temperature, so I don't have a number.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:05",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.fever+infection.rash"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you, that's fine. In the last two weeks, has he travelled overseas, or been around anyone who was sick with something catching?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:14",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:infection.travel_14d+infection.contacts"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "No, he hasn't travelled anywhere, and he hasn't been around anyone who's sick.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:15",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:infection.travel_14d+infection.contacts"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thanks for that. Just to check, has anyone at home or close to him had a cough, cold, flu or tummy bug lately?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:21",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:infection.contacts"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "No, no one at home or close to him has been sick, and he hasn't been around anyone ill.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:22",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:infection.contacts"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thanks for checking on that. Compared with how he usually is, does he seem more confused, more sleepy, or just not himself today?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:29",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:ams.changed_from_baseline"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "No, he's awake and talking normally, not confused or sleepy. He's just more short of breath than usual.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:31",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:ams.changed_from_baseline"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thanks for letting me know he's more short of breath than usual. Is he in any pain right now, and if so, how bad is it from 0 to 10, where 10 is the worst pain imaginable?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:39",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He has no pain.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:40",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you, good to know he has no pain. Is his breathing getting harder for him than it was earlier today?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:47",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.increasing_respiratory_effort"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He's been more short of breath than usual since this morning. I can't say for sure if it's got worse since then, but he's still talking in full sentences.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:49",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.increasing_respiratory_effort"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you for explaining. Compared with this morning, does he seem to be struggling more to catch his breath now?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:46:59",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.increasing_respiratory_effort"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "I'm not sure if he's worse than this morning. He's been more short of breath than usual since then, but he can still speak in full sentences.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:01",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.increasing_respiratory_effort"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you, that's helpful to know he can still speak in full sentences. What medicines does he take regularly (you can also send a photo of the boxes), and is he allergic to any medicines?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:08",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:M.medications+A.allergies"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He takes a water pill (frusemide) and an inhaler, and he's not on any blood thinners. He has no allergies.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:10",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:M.medications+A.allergies"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you for listing his medicines and confirming he has no allergies. Does he have any ongoing health conditions, and has a doctor ever said his immune system is weak, for example from cancer treatment, steroids or other medicines that lower his defences against infection?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:19",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:history.conditions+history.immunocompromised"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He has heart failure and COPD. No one has said his immune system is weak, and I don't know of any cancer treatment or steroids.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:20",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:history.conditions+history.immunocompromised"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you for telling me about his heart failure and COPD. What is his full name?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:29",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:identity.name"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "His surname is Lim, but I don't know his full name to give you here.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:31",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:identity.name"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "That's enough for the hospital team to prepare. Show the code PANDA-6043 at the counter when you arrive. I'll ask a few more things while you're on the way; tell me straight away if anything changes.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:35",
   "kind": "ack"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Right now, is Mr Lim breathing fast, only able to say a few words at a time, sitting forward to breathe, or wheezing loudly enough that you can hear it?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:38",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.respiratory_distress_signs"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He's talking in full sentences and isn't wheezing, but he's more short of breath than usual since this morning. I don't know if he's breathing fast, and I haven't noticed him sitting forward.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:39",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.respiratory_distress_signs"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you, that's helpful to pass on. When did Mr Lim last eat or drink anything, and what was it?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:49",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:L.last_intake"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He last ate toast at 8am. I don't know about anything to drink since then.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:47:50",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:L.last_intake"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you - that's everything. Show the code PANDA-6043 at the counter when you arrive.",
